      "writtenOn": "2024-05-10T17:53:37Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Shall we stop being redundant? For any host command, senders are always supposed to set the packet size (i.e. args-\u003eparams_size). We probably don\u0027t want senders to set sizes in two places. I can\u0027t think of a compelling advantage with this redundancy. It seems Abe is also ok with it.",
      "parentUuid": "c2a785c7_4b2eb3a9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 7875,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 7875,
